Comment: Upstream's LICENSE file is the plain GNU GPL version 3 notice -- the
 "This program is free software..." paragraphs -- without the full licence
 text and without an SPDX identifier. That is why GitHub's licence detector
 reports NOASSERTION for this repository rather than GPL-3.0. The notice
 itself is unambiguous: version 3 "or (at your option) any later version",
 i.e. GPL-3.0+.

